    "timestamp": "2034-04-13T00:00:00Z",
    "period": "2020-04-01/2034-04-03",
    "regime_notes": "Validated across 1,976 dates and 15 tradable instruments; mean valid N 11.92. Positive in 2025-2027, 2028-2029, 2030-2032, and 2033-2034 regimes. VIX is observation-only and is not tradable.",
